<title>INDONESIA: Dharmala Sakti 1996 net at 81.95 bln rph.</title>
<headline>Dharmala Sakti 1996 net at 81.95 bln rph.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twelve months to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>		(in billion rupiah unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			     81.95 vs 67.54</p>
<p>    Net income per share (rupiah)	253 vs 208</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit			 142.62 vs 114.93</p>
<p>    Revenues				 562.05 vs 410.06</p>
<p>    Operating profit		     136.72 vs 111.20</p>
<p>Note : The results were audited. PT Dharmala Sakti Sejahtera, a member of the Dharmala Group, is an investment holding company.</p>
</text>
